
# Prime Private Center

A modern RGB neon educational website.

## Features
- Public website for students
- Admin login for authorized admins
- Lessons and study topics
- Homework and assignments
- Important notices
- Class routines
- Live database updates
- Mobile responsive design

## Technologies
- React
- Vite
- Supabase
- Cloudflare Pages

## Setup

Install dependencies:

npm install

Start development server:

npm run dev

Build website:

npm run build

## Environment

Supabase project URL and public anon key are configured in src/supabase.js.

Never expose your Supabase service_role or secret key.

## Deployment

Build command: npm run build

Output directory: dist
